<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Statewide legal protections for LGBTQ people who experience discrimination</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Currently, about a quarter of Ohioans live in localities that have nondiscrimination ordinances on the books. This is unacceptable — nobody should be forced to move simply to have an opportunity to go to work and provide for their families.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
