<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Keeping our elders resourced and free from discrimination</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>LGBTQ+ elders face increased rates of discrimination and poverty. Our elders fought for the LGBTQ+ community’s rights, and they deserve to be safe and not experience discrimination.</p>
