<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Curb bullying</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>LGBTQ+ youth — and youth perceived to be LGBTQ+ — are often bullied. The first step to addressing bullying is to enumerate LGBTQ+ youth in anti‑bullying legislation, but that’s not enough. Comprehensive bullying prevention involves addressing the school climate and district‑level policy.</p>
